00:14:45.502 --> 00:14:47.087
Cái--

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.464
Boyd, chúng ta đang làm gì vậy ?

00:14:49.548 --> 00:14:51.758
Không lẽ... chúng ta...

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.179
